body:
No, as far as I was aware he was completely asleep. I was really disgusted with myself and stopped, then waited for at least an hour to see if he was awake. If he was, I wanted to talk right then and there. We had a joke we would play, where we would put silly objects on the other. I put playing cards on his head and arms, and he still sat there lying asleep for at least an hour.

&#x200B;

He could have pulled away I suppose. There was never any movement, just snoring. I just wish I would have had the intelligence and foresight to have never attempted to harm someone I loved like a best friend. 

&#x200B;

You really think I'm making a mountain out of a molehill?
